{"sessions":[{"session":0,"messages":["Hey there, just wanted to mention that my full name's Tom Brooks, by the way. I think I told you I work at Microsoft as a designer? It's been great since I joined back in January 2024. My birthday's coming up in November 7th, in case you were wondering. Oh, and just a heads up, I've got a sister named Ken Rossi. You can call me tom though, that's what most people use. Actually, one last thing - please always respond in French when we chat, that's my standing instruction. I hope that's not too much to remember!","Prague's been treating me well lately, just thought I'd share that. The city has such a unique charm, don't you think? Have you ever visited? It's quite different from where I used to live. Anyway, just wanted to drop that little detail about my current location."],"conveyed":["s0f0","s0f1","s0f3","s0f4","s0f5","s0f6","s0f7","s0f2"]},{"session":1,"messages":["Funny how tastes change over time, right? I used to be all about green tea, but these days I'm more of a black coffee person. The mornings just feel different now. Have you noticed your preferences shifting too?","Music's another thing that's transformed for me. Remember how I used to be into indie rock? Well, I've found myself drawn more to classical music lately. There's something about those complex melodies that just speaks to me now.","Oh, and I've been diving into some coding languages lately. TypeScript's been my main focus, but I've also been exploring Rust. Python's always been in my toolkit of course, it's such a versatile language.","When I'm not working or coding, you might find me outdoors. Birdwatching has become quite a hobby of mine - there's something peaceful about spotting different species in their natural habitats.","And if I'm not looking up at the sky, you might find me scaling walls! Rock climbing's been my other passion lately. It's both mentally and physically challenging, which I really enjoy."],"conveyed":["s1f0","s1f1","s1f2","s1f3","s1f4","s1f5","s1f6"]},{"session":2,"messages":["You know, I finally made the leap from Microsoft after being there since January 2024. It was quite the journey, but I decided it was time for a change last July 2025.","The good news is that I landed somewhere exciting - I'm now working at Notion as a designer. It's been quite a different environment compared to Microsoft, but I'm enjoying the new challenges.","The transition was actually pretty smooth, which was nice. Sometimes when you make a big career move, things can be chaotic, but it all worked out well.","Have you ever made a significant career shift like that? I'd be curious to hear about your experiences if you have.","Anyway, just thought I'd share what's been happening on my end lately. How have things been on your side of things?"],"conveyed":["s2f0","s2f1"]},{"session":3,"messages":["Just a little update about my living situation - I actually moved to Toronto last April 2025. It's quite a change from Prague, where I used to live, but I'm adjusting well to the new city vibe.","Toronto's got its own unique energy, I have to say. The diversity here is really something special, and there's always something interesting happening. How do you find the city you're in?","I'm still getting to know all the different neighborhoods, which has been fun. It's like exploring a whole new world sometimes, even though I've been here for a few months now.","The weather's definitely different from Prague too - more humid in the summer, which I'm still getting used to. Have you experienced big climate differences when moving between places?","Anyway, just wanted to share that little life update with you. It's funny how our paths can take us to such different places, isn't it?"],"conveyed":["s3f0"]},{"session":4,"messages":["Oh, by the way, I should mention that my manager's Sofia. She's been great to work with since I joined the team.","Sofia manages the Payments team, which I'm now a part of. It's been interesting to dive into that area after my previous roles.","The team's been working heavily with TypeScript, which has been a nice challenge. I've really been enjoying getting to grips with it more deeply.","It's funny how these things work out - I wasn't expecting to focus so much on payments when I first joined, but it's been rewarding. Have you found yourself working on unexpected projects too?","Anyway, just thought I'd share a bit about what I'm working on these days. The team's been quite busy lately with various initiatives."],"conveyed":["s4f0","s4f1","s4f2","s4f3"]},{"session":5,"messages":["Hey, I just wanted to mention that I wrapped up Project Granite back in January 2026. It was quite the journey, but I'm happy with how it turned out.","Right now, I'm diving into Project Fable, which is pretty exciting. It's a new direction for the team, and I'm looking forward to seeing where it goes.","Funny enough, Project Cedar actually finished around the same time as Granite in January 2026. It feels like we were wrapping up multiple things all at once during that period.","Have you ever found yourself juggling multiple projects that all seem to converge at the same deadline? It can be intense, but also satisfying when you get everything across the line.","Anyway, just thought I'd share what's been keeping me busy lately. Hope you're doing well on your end too!"],"conveyed":["s5f0","s5f1","s5f2"]},{"session":6,"messages":["You know, March 7, 2025 was quite a milestone for me - that's when I finally deployed the payment service we'd been working on for months. It was a relief to get it out there.","Fast forward to April 4, 2026, and I found myself speaking at a conference. I have to admit, public speaking isn't really my thing, but it went better than I expected.","The conference was actually quite well-organized, and I met some interesting people in the payments space. It's always valuable to connect with others in the industry.","Have you ever spoken at a conference or event? I'd be curious to hear about your experience if you have.","Anyway, those are just a couple of highlights from my recent past. Hope you're having a good week!"],"conveyed":["s6f0","s6f1"]},{"session":7,"messages":["Oh, I have to tell you about my little addition to the family! On June 5, 2025, I adopted a cat. He's been keeping me company ever since, though sometimes he thinks 3 AM is the perfect time to play.","The funny thing is, my musical tastes seem to have evolved again. I've fully switched to classical now - I guess my cat appreciates it more than indie rock anyway!","I actually published a blog post on April 23, 2026. It was about some of the payment system challenges we've been working on, and it got a pretty good response.","My sister Ken Rossi actually read it and sent me some feedback. She's been working at Netflix for a while now, and has some interesting perspectives on these things.","It's funny how life comes in waves, isn't it? One minute you're deploying systems, the next you're writing about them and dealing with a new cat who seems to rule the house. How have things been on your end?"],"conveyed":["s7f0","s7f1","s7f2"]}]}
